sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Reviewer
    participant W as Workflow Engine
    participant O as Outbox (DB)
    participant K as Worker + Adapter
    participant T as External System (Target)

    U->>W: Clicks "Approve"
    Note over W,O: State + note saved in ONE transaction (atomic)
    W->>O: Write note (pending) + state = "Waiting"
    W-->>U: "Received, in progress"

    loop Every 5 seconds
        K->>O: Pull pending notes
    end
    K->>T: Send action (HTTP + OperationId)

    alt Fast Target - synchronous
        T-->>K: Success / Failure (immediately)
    else Slow Target - polling
        T-->>K: "Accepted, id 123"
        K->>O: Release, check later
        K->>T: "Done yet?" (asks again)
        T-->>K: Success / Failure
    else Slow Target - callback
        T-->>K: "Accepted, id 123"
        Note over T,W: Later the Target calls US
        T->>W: webhook with the result
    end

    Note over W: Success/Failure transition (WaitingState guard blocks overwrite)
    W->>O: Write notification/mail (new note)
    K->>T: (actually send the notification)
    W-->>U: Inquiry advanced + notification
